\item[S2] Alexei Lisitsa, \emph{Stable Andrews--Curtis trivialization of AK(3) revisited. A case study using automated deduction}, arXiv:2501.18601v1 (2025), Section 1, moves AC1--AC3 and Conjecture 1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2501.18601}.
